msgid "Taco-flavored, tortilla snack fried in oil. A flatbread made from cornmeal dough, the tortilla is a traditional staple of Central America that is widely used for soft shell tacos. "
msgstr "油炸玉米饼零食，塔可味。玉米面团制成的薄饼是中美传统主食，广泛用于软壳塔可。"

